<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cultus falls into loss for 95/96.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cultus falls into loss for 95/96.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 10.66 vs  12.46</p>
<p>    Net			    loss 4.64 vs profit 12.46</p>
<p>    Sales				55.46 vs 54.58</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Cultus Petroleum Ltd is a oil and gas producer. Cultus major shareholders are New Zealand bankers Michael Fay and David Richwhite, who own 30 percent of the issued capital.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
